			x: 6.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["5331DFDEAD7A36A2"]
			description: ["GT--'s &6Large Naquadah Reactor&r on excited fuel is the era's main plant. It asks for duranium frames here, so the Mk2's metal is part of the price. Feed the spent fuel back to the fuel works."]
