			dependencies: ["783B3D8BCDE41DB7"]
			description: ["Old reactor waste is still sitting in your storage. The &6Waste Retrieval Plant&r digs it out and gives radon and a radium capsule back. The radon is what the Mk2 wants for excited fuel."]
